  "solution": {
    "text": "<p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><munder><mi>lim</mi><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow></munder><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\"><mfrac><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>&#8722;</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\"><mi>x</mi></mfenced></mrow><mrow><mi>&#955;</mi><mo>&#8722;</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><mi>x</mi></mfenced></mrow></mfrac></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mi>L</mi></math></p><p>Let&#39;s find left-hand and right-hand limit.</p><p>For left-hand limit</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>-</mo><mi>h</mi><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>h</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>h</mi><mo>&#62;</mo><mn>0</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>L</mi><mi>H</mi><mi>L</mi><mo>=</mo><munder><mi>lim</mi><mrow><mi>h</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow></munder><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\"><mfrac><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>&#8722;</mo><mfenced><mrow><mo>-</mo><mi>h</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\"><mrow><mo>-</mo><mi>h</mi></mrow></mfenced></mrow><mrow><mi>&#955;</mi><mo>&#8722;</mo><mfenced><mrow><mo>-</mo><mi>h</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><mrow><mo>-</mo><mi>h</mi></mrow></mfenced></mrow></mfrac></mfenced></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>L</mi><mi>H</mi><mi>L</mi><mo>=</mo><munder><mi>lim</mi><mrow><mi>h</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow></munder><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\"><mfrac><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mi>h</mi><mo>-</mo><mfenced><mrow><mo>-</mo><mi>h</mi></mrow></mfenced></mrow><mrow><mi>&#955;</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>h</mi><mo>+</mo><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><mrow><mo>-</mo><mi>h</mi></mrow></mfenced></mrow></mfrac></mfenced></math></p><p>Since&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>h</mi><mo>&#62;</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#8658;</mo><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><mrow><mo>-</mo><mi>h</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>L</mi><mi>H</mi><mi>L</mi><mo>=</mo><munder><mi>lim</mi><mrow><mi>h</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow></munder><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\"><mfrac><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mi>h</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>h</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>&#955;</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>h</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfrac></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\"><mrow><mi>&#955;</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced></mfrac></math></p><p>For right-hand limit</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>+</mo><mi>h</mi><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>h</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>h</mi><mo>&#62;</mo><mn>0</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>R</mi><mi>H</mi><mi>L</mi><mo>=</mo><munder><mi>lim</mi><mrow><mi>h</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow></munder><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\"><mfrac><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>&#8722;</mo><mi>h</mi><mo>+</mo><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\"><mi>h</mi></mfenced></mrow><mrow><mi>&#955;</mi><mo>&#8722;</mo><mi>h</mi><mo>+</mo><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><mi>h</mi></mfenced></mrow></mfrac></mfenced></math></p><p>Since&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>h</mi><mo>&#62;</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#8658;</mo><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><mi>h</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>R</mi><mi>H</mi><mi>L</mi><mo>=</mo><munder><mi>lim</mi><mrow><mi>h</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow></munder><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\"><mfrac><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mi>h</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>h</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>&#955;</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>h</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow></mfrac></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\"><mi>&#955;</mi></mfenced></mfrac></math></p><p>For existence of limit&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>L</mi><mi>H</mi><mi>L</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>R</mi><mi>H</mi><mi>L</mi></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\"><mrow><mi>&#955;</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\"><mi>&#955;</mi></mfenced></mfrac></math></p><p>Cross multiply and square both side.</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><msup><mi>&#955;</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><msup><mfenced><mrow><mi>&#955;</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#8658;</mo><msup><mi>&#955;</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><msup><mi>&#955;</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>&#955;</mi></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>&#955;</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac></math></p><p>Limit&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>L</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mstyle displaystyle=\"true\"><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac></mstyle></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn></math></p>",
